    <section id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
      <h2 id="about-heading">About Ethiopia</h2>
      <p>
        Ethiopia is a land of stunning landscapes and ancient civilizations.
        From the Simien Mountains to the rock-hewn churches of Lalibela,
        it offers an unmatched blend of nature and history.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="destinations" aria-labelledby="destinations-heading">
      <h2 id="destinations-heading">Top Destinations</h2>
      <article>
        <h3>Lalibela</h3>
        <p>
          Famous for its monolithic rock-cut churches, Lalibela is a UNESCO World Heritage Site and a spiritual center for Ethiopian Orthodox Christians.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>Simien Mountains</h3>
        <p>
          Home to dramatic cliffs and unique wildlife like the gelada monkey, this mountain range offers breathtaking hiking experiences.
        </p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section id="culture" aria-labelledby="culture-heading">
      <h2 id="culture-heading">Rich Culture</h2>
      <p>
        Ethiopia's cultural heritage is deeply rooted in its music, language, art, and traditional cuisine. The country is also known for its coffee, believed to have originated here.
      </p>
    </section>
